{"id":50185,"date":"2026-03-28T06:19:01","date_gmt":"2026-03-28T05:19:01","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50185"},"modified":"2026-11-08T13:29:34","modified_gmt":"2026-11-08T12:29:34","slug":"montalegre-urban-fit","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/montalegre-urban-fit\/","title":{"rendered":"Montalegre Urban Fit 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Montalegre Urban Fit 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Montalegre Urban Fit 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>6 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>, a partir das <strong>15:00<\/strong>, na vila hist\u00f3rica de <strong>Montalegre<\/strong>, em pleno cora\u00e7\u00e3o das terras do Barroso, no distrito de Vila Real. Integrada na Liga oficial da <strong>Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Corrida de Obst\u00e1culos (FPOCR)<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o alia o desafio do OCR urbano \u00e0 paisagem gran\u00edtica dominada pelo imponente Castelo de Montalegre.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida instalada na <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio<\/strong> e linha de meta no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Montalegre<\/strong>, vais enfrentar um tra\u00e7ado de <strong>9 km com 30 obst\u00e1culos<\/strong> de diferentes n\u00edveis de dificuldade e um tempo limite de 2 horas e 30 minutos. As partidas decorrem por blocos a partir das 15:00 nas categorias <strong>Elite Liga FPOCR<\/strong> (3 pulseiras), <strong>Elite Internacional<\/strong> (3 pulseiras), <strong>Liga Competitive<\/strong> (6 pulseiras) e no escal\u00e3o aberto <strong>Guerreiro<\/strong> (individual ou por equipas, com op\u00e7\u00e3o de 20 burpees em caso de falha no obst\u00e1culo).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>Urban Fit Race<\/strong> (Alfredo Leandro Vieira Unipessoal Lda) com o apoio da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Montalegre<\/strong>, a prova assume igualmente um cariz solid\u00e1rio a favor de uma institui\u00e7\u00e3o local, atribuindo na chegada os trof\u00e9us <em>Montalegre Man, Women e Team Fit 2027<\/em> e o pr\u00e9mio Finisher a todos os atletas que superem o desafio.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rg