gin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83c\udf92 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Material Obrigat\u00f3rio:<\/strong> Dorsal e chip obrigat\u00f3rio (penaliza\u00e7\u00e3o de 20 burpees por obst\u00e1culo recusado)<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 08\/11\/2026:<\/strong> 28.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (14\/09 a 08\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 27\/12\/2026:<\/strong> 30.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (09\/11 a 27\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 07\/02\/2027:<\/strong> 32.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (28\/12\/2026 a 07\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 28\/02\/2027:<\/strong> 34.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (08\/02 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza o Montalegre Urban Fit 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 6 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com in\u00edcio das v\u00e1rias vagas de partida \u00e0s 15:00 na Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio e meta instalada no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Montalegre.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia, o n\u00famero de obst\u00e1culos e o tempo limite?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso tem cerca de 9 km e 30 obst\u00e1culos urbanos de diferentes graus de exig\u00eancia, dispondo os participantes de um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 2 horas e 30 minutos para concluir a prova.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es dispon\u00edveis e as diferen\u00e7as regulamentares?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Existem 4 categorias: Elite Liga FPOCR e Elite Internacional (competi\u00e7\u00e3o com 3 pulseiras anti-viola\u00e7\u00e3o), Liga Competitive FPOCR (competi\u00e7\u00e3o com 6 pulseiras) e Guerreiro (escal\u00e3o aberto individual ou equipas de m\u00ednimo 3 atletas, onde a recusa de obst\u00e1culo implica 20 burpees).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui o kit de atleta?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Nos escal\u00f5es Elite e Competitive os valores individuais variam entre 34 \u20ac (at\u00e9 08\/11\/2026) e 40 \u20ac (at\u00e9 28\/02\/2027), enquanto no escal\u00e3o Guerreiro variam entre 28 \u20ac e 34 \u20ac (com desconto de 2 \u20ac por atleta em inscri\u00e7\u00f5es por equipa). O kit inclui dorsal, chip obrigat\u00f3rio, seguro e pr\u00e9mio Finisher, sendo a camisola de manga comprida opcional (15 \u20ac).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rio funciona o secretariado para entrega de kits?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A entrega dos kits decorre exclusivamente no dia da prova, 6 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, entre as 10:00 e as 14:00, no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Montalegre.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Montalegre Urban Fit 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-06\", \"endDate\": \"20